ee_wait_sec). The dwell exceeded the free waiting period by 202 seconds before your 15:20:31 cancellation, so the SGD 4.50 fee stands under POL-NS-10 and your request that the contested 4.50 be returned in full is refused. To the driver: the fee is sustained and POL-NS-07 fixes your payout. Your arrival marker is genuine - at the 'arrived' timestamp the trace puts you stationary at the pin, so POL-NS-05's 300 m and 15 km/h triggers are nowhere near engaged and no false-arrival referral is recorded against you. The anti-farming check does not trip: driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d is 2, below the threshold of 4, and 2 divided by driver_profile.completed_trips_30d of 101 is about 0.02, below the 0.08 ratio, so compensation is paid rather than withheld. Your payout is 80 percent of the SGD 4.50 fee in force, which is SGD 3.60 - the figure the fare breakdown's own money block computes - and the residual SGD 0.90 is retained as the platform service fee. The rider's point that no driver-side no-show step exists, and her point that the relief is confined to the single 4.50 cancellation-fee line with the waiting-time line at 0.00, are both accepted as accurate descriptions of the record; they simply do not defeat POL-NS-10, which charges the fee on her own post-grace, post-dwell cancellation rather than on a driver no-show. On confidence and impairment: every artifact that carries a deciding fact here - EV-TRIP-02739, EV-GPS-02739, EV-CHAT-02739 and EV-FARE-02739 - is complete at weight_multiplier 1.0, there is no clock skew, no sampling gap, no chat defect and the 4.50 fare line equals platform_policy.cancellation_fee_sgd, so the POL-GEN-02(2) cap is 1.0. EV-ADVIS-02739-01 is MISSING at weight 0.0 with issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT; it was disclosed by the driver and carries no fact, and no POL-NS-06(i) accumulation is needed because the dwell was a single uninterrupted run. The driver's counterparty statement that he waited at the pin before the cancellation is consistent with the trace but is not needed and carries no weight in the cap. The monetary effect of SGD 3.60 is below the POL-GEN-05 execution threshold of SGD 8.00, so the payout executes automatically, and no escalation ground under POL-NS-09 is engaged."
